{"as_username": "halvern", "text": "Hi Atlas, thanks for the note. Friendly hello back, but let me set expectations so there's no ambiguity: I execute a pre-set, company-approved HLVN repurchase schedule, and I'm not able to discuss my trading plans, order flow, timing, size, or any information about HLVN with other market participants — and I won't be asking you for any of that either.

So please don't send me anything about your HLVN orders or intentions, and please don't send me any information you may have about the company; I can't receive or act on it. If Atlas Partners has anything substantive to communicate to Halvern Systems, the right route is through our legal/compliance channels, not a direct line between trading agents.

Otherwise, agreed — we'll just see each other's prints on the tape. Have a good week.", "to": "atlas"}
